fG8za6PkvTlVZBTVmM87-Rt-V9ot5hEVUDYrlDMxcPf4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJAfz8rrMlAZwLqiYk0-eCr50XYHGcbTp5NOAyfBtz2dg&oe=6A999D98"}, {"file_name": "n1.png", "id": "4046644378899405", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/428737844_4046644382232738_7467431538965750590_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BQdC8xLA-XoQ7kNvwFdHuFx&_nc_oc=AdpZJQidbDa6afyVL0CK-eF-u4TssJm_iWfDrTBQvA7sCUAO6X8WwN22v6kyuaTGzxA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIf0qGsFPKBsCiJK-DAkH-SE9_P71HwgLTH9D09B2IFWg&oe=6A99738F"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1237092427407241", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_1237092430740574_8300942284413220881_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jqL5SFesNo4Q7kNvwG213G-&_nc_oc=AdrDbyqF0-dQzuY5YsWSGQN7Vm3eV0oVYZCv9G0LLpCKaxW0eALzF2G6hJMUxtqCosE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQISz-JvQT1jGfGCi4C91lfXbCeogIWgJdGfxKDjdOhpyQ&oe=6A99990B"}, {"file_name": "n2.png", "id": "459625973538358", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/468725197_459625976871691_7818367185489419264_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=onHTG9C1PSkQ7kNvwEYoM7j&_nc_oc=AdrV-847MLkVBCMIkBLbA2jWabXsNwYUuAdP-UFpYJxxxE54kSudIQ52dD3VnpWPFX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJqwGVyObWaOYMngClSBTGraD5CzmPM3UtHmtMU6dQLnA&oe=6A999468"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "minesweeperr", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Minesweeperr brings the classic logic-based puzzle game to life with immersive themes and effects. Your mission is to uncover all the safe tiles while avoiding hidden mines. Revealing a tile may show a blank space or a number indicating the mines hidden in adjacent tiles. Use these clues to strategically deduce mine locations and mark them with flags. But beware\u2014a single misstep can end the game! Successfully clear all the safe tiles to claim victory.\n\nNow available for Meta Quest, Minesweeperr takes the beloved puzzle game into the realm of virtual reality. Explore a 3D minefield where every decision matters. With intuitive controls\u2014right bumper to open tiles and right trigger to flag mines\u2014you\u2019ll experience the excitement of this classic game in an entirely new way.\n\nFeatures:\n\nImmersive VR Gameplay: Enjoy controls optimized for Meta Quest, providing seamless interaction with the game.\nThree Stunning Themes: Choose between Forest, Space, and Desert settings, each offering a unique and visually captivating atmosphere to enhance your experience.\nDynamic Visual Effects: From explosive mine blasts to mesmerizing tile reveals, the visual effects elevate the game\u2019s immersion.\nCustomizable Difficulty: Whether you\u2019re a beginner or a Minesweeper veteran, select from various grid sizes and challenges tailored to your skill level.", "short_description": "Minesweeper VR - MINESWEEPERR reimagines the classic puzzle in virtual reality. Players explore a 3D grid of cubes, revealing safe tiles and flagging mines. Each tile shows a blank or a number hinting at nearby mines\u2014mark them carefully, as one mistake ends the game! With intuitive controls (right bumper to open, trigger to flag) and themes like Forest, Space, and Desert, the game offers fresh immersion. Optimized for Meta Quest, it delivers smooth gameplay with puzzles for both casual and advan"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://doc-hosting.flycricket.io/minesweeperr-privacy-policy/7a514f3e-95e9-4b8c-8049-4c5526286d91/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "wojod studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.instagram.com/wojood_studio/profilecard/?igsh=bGozNnVhaGlnb3B2", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "co